# ── Commit message guide (50/72 rule) ──────────────────────────────
# Subject: imperative, <= 50 chars, capitalized, no trailing period.
# |<-------------- 50-character limit ------------->|

#
# Body (optional): wrap at 72 chars. Explain *what* and *why*, not how.
# |<------------------------- 72-character limit ---------------------->|
